  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 50 * 95 * 19 * 15 * 3 * 1.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) =, ÷, +, ×, × **\n\nGiven: 50 * 95 * 19 * 15 * 3 * 1 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 50 = __**95 ÷ 19**__ + 15 × 3 × 1 \n\n⇒ 50 = 5 + __**15 × 3 × 1**__\n\n⇒ 50 = __**5 + 45**__\n\n⇒ **50 = 50**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) +, =, ÷, +, +\n\nGiven: 50 * 95 * 19 * 15 * 3 * 1 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 50 + 95 = __**19 ÷ 15**__ + 3 + 1 \n\n⇒ __**50 + 95**__ = __**1.27 + 3 + 1 **__\n\n⇒ 145 ≠ 5.27\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) +, ×, ×, =, ÷\n\nGiven: 50 * 95 * 19 * 15 * 3 * 1 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 50 + 95 × 19 × 15 = __**3 ÷ 1 **__\n\n⇒ 50 + __**95 × 19 × 15**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**50 + 27075**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 27125 ≠ 3\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ×, +, =, ÷, × \n\nGiven: 50 * 95 * 19 * 15 * 3 * 1 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 50 × 95 + 19 = __**15 ÷ 3**__ × 1 \n\n⇒ __**50 ×**____** 95**__ + 19 = __**5 × 1**__ \n\n⇒ __4750 + 19__ = 5\n\n⇒ 4769 ≠ 5\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
